  "appDescription": "The FL Orchestrator AE as a MEC application (TD_MEC_FL_01 pre-condition: TD_MEC_REG_03 for the orchestrator). It registers the AE, its metadata policy and its baseline container; the orchestration logic runs in the driver under the same originator. The CSE named here is the test plan's (MEC_CFG_03: the orchestrator at the cloud IN-CSE); the run writes a copy naming cse-mn-a for edge-only mode.",
